      ],
      "source": "https://nyfalls.com/waterfalls/delphi-falls/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The hamlet sits within the Delphi Falls County Park, which opened to the public in August 2018.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://uncoveringnewyork.com/delphi-falls/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Limestone Creek runs through the park, and the surrounding area has long hosted limestone quarries.",
